      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, why did you flag Post 1 as \"Borderline\"? It's just some slang about working hard and people being difficult. Do you think the language itself is inherently toxic or \"coded,\" or is it something else? I need to understand if our filter is being too sensitive to certain dialects.",
